Bundled AgentGuard runtime
==========================

This directory contains the AgentGuard Python client, shared rule runtime, and
local skill modules, vendored from the AgentGuard research implementation.
Only runtime Python sources are included; servers, examples, tests, generated
files, and caches are intentionally excluded.

The bundled copy includes a local-enforcement integration change: explicit
policy snapshot rules are evaluated before remote fallback so standalone mode
can enforce configured DSL policies.

